  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the robata grill to medium-high heat.",
    "In a large bowl, whisk together fish sauce, lime juice, brown sugar, fermented jang sauce, garlic, and ginger.",
    "Add the chicken to the bowl and toss to coat with the marinade.",
    "Thread the marinated chicken onto skewers, if desired.",
    "Brush the grill with vegetable oil to prevent sticking.",
    "Grill the chicken for 5-6 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "Season the chicken with salt and black pepper.",
    "Serve the chicken hot with additional fermented jang sauce on the side."
